---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '@/components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Feature your event | LeeScoop" description="Submit a Lee County event for LeeScoop calendar consideration.">
  <Header />
  <main class="wrap page-shell feature-event-page">
    <section class="feature-event-hero panel-glow">
      <div class="feature-event-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">LeeScoop calendar</p>
        <h1>Feature your event.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Tell us about your Lee County event. After you submit, you’ll continue to the $50 secure payment step.
        </p>
        <div class="feature-price-card" aria-label="Feature fee">
          <span>$50</span>
          <strong>flat feature review</strong>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="feature-event-action" aria-label="Submission action">
        <p class="feature-action-kicker">Secure review</p>
        <h2>Send the details. We’ll shape the feature.</h2>
        <p>
          Share the basics, add an image if you have one, or ask LeeScoop to create a clean event cover.
        </p>
        <p class="feature-event-note">You’ll continue to the secure $50 payment step after submitting.</p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-event-form-panel panel-glow" aria-labelledby="feature-event-form-title">
      <div class="feature-form-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Event details</p>
        <h2 id="feature-event-form-title">Submit your event</h2>
        <p>Fill in as much as you can. Only the event name is required here. If you leave contact details blank, Stripe will still collect payment info during checkout.</p>
      </div>

      <form id="feature-event-form" class="feature-event-form" data-feature-event-form>
        <input class="feature-event-hp" type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />

        <label>
          <span>Event name *</span>
          <input name="eventName" autocomplete="off" required maxlength="160" />
        </label>

        <div class="feature-form-row">
          <label>
            <span>Date</span>
            <input name="eventDate" type="date" />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Time</span>
            <input name="eventTime" placeholder="7:00 PM, all day, varies…" maxlength="120" />
          </label>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-form-row">
          <label>
            <span>Venue / location</span>
            <input name="venue" maxlength="180" />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>City / area</span>
            <input name="city" maxlength="100" placeholder="Fort Myers, Cape Coral…" />
          </label>
        </div>

        <label>
          <span>Address</span>
          <input name="address" maxlength="220" />
        </label>

        <div class="feature-form-row">
          <label>
            <span>Official event link</span>
            <input name="eventUrl" inputmode="url" placeholder="Website, Facebook event, flyer link, or leave blank" maxlength="500" />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Ticket / RSVP link</span>
            <input name="ticketUrl" inputmode="url" placeholder="Ticket link, RSVP note, or leave blank" maxlength="500" />
          </label>
        </div>

        <label>
          <span>Short event description</span>
          <textarea name="description" maxlength="2200" rows="5" placeholder="What is happening, who is invited, and what makes it worth checking out?"></textarea>
        </label>

        <fieldset class="feature-image-fieldset">
          <legend>Event image</legend>
          <p class="feature-image-help">Best image: horizontal, 1216 × 704 px or larger. JPG, PNG, or WebP. Max upload: 1.5 MB.</p>
          <div class="feature-image-options" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Event image preference">
            <label class="feature-choice-card">
              <input type="radio" name="imagePreference" value="generate" checked />
              <span>
                <strong>Generate one for me</strong>
                <small>LeeScoop will make a clean local-style cover image.</small>
              </span>
            </label>
            <label class="feature-choice-card">
              <input type="radio" name="imagePreference" value="provided" />
              <span>
                <strong>I have my own image</strong>
                <small>Upload it below or paste a public image/flyer link.</small>
              </span>
            </label>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-form-row feature-image-inputs">
            <label>
              <span>Upload image</span>
              <input name="imageUpload" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Image / flyer link</span>
              <input name="imageUrl" inputmode="url" placeholder="Google Drive, website image, flyer link…" maxlength="500" />
            </label>
          </div>
          <p class="feature-image-status" data-feature-image-status>No image selected yet.</p>
          <label>
            <span>Image notes</span>
            <input name="imageNotes" maxlength="500" placeholder="Optional: photo credit, crop request, or style note" />
          </label>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="feature-form-row">
          <label>
            <span>Organizer name</span>
            <input name="organizerName" maxlength="140" />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Your email</span>
            <input name="organizerEmail" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" placeholder="Optional, but helpful for follow-up" />
          </label>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-form-row">
          <label>
            <span>Organizer phone</span>
            <input name="organizerPhone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="80" />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Expected attendance</span>
            <input name="expectedAttendance" maxlength="80" placeholder="Optional" />
          </label>
        </div>

        <label>
          <span>Anything else?</span>
          <textarea name="notes" maxlength="1200" rows="4" placeholder="Photos, sponsors, parking notes, age restrictions, etc."></textarea>
        </label>

        <div class="feature-form-submit-row">
          <button class="button primary feature-submit-button" type="submit">Submit event and continue to payment</button>
          <p class="feature-event-note">Your email is private. If left blank, payment/contact details can be handled through Stripe.</p>
        </div>

        <p class="feature-form-status" data-feature-event-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section class="feature-event-grid homepage-section">
      <article class="panel-glow">
        <p class="eyebrow">What happens next</p>
        <ol class="feature-steps">
          <li><span>1</span><p>Submit the private event form.</p></li>
          <li><span>2</span><p>You’ll be sent to Stripe to pay the $50 feature review fee.</p></li>
          <li><span>3</span><p>Paid submissions enter the LeeScoop calendar/article review queue.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </article>

      <article class="panel-glow">
        <p class="eyebrow">What to include</p>
        <ul class="signal-list compact feature-checklist">
          <li><strong>Basics</strong><span>Event name, date, time, city, venue, and address.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Link</strong><span>Ticket page, RSVP page, Facebook event, or official source.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Blurb</strong><span>Two or three friendly sentences about what people can expect.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Contact</strong><span>A real organizer contact in case something needs confirmation.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
  <script is:inline type="module" src="/scripts/feature-event.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
